### =========================================================================
### ⚙️ [변수 설정]
### =========================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### =========================================================================
### 🔐 [인증] 사전 필수 단계 (2개)
### =========================================================================
### 1. [Auth] 테스트용 계정 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test5@test.com",
  "password": "password123!",
  "nickname": "테스트유저5"
}

### 2. [Auth] 테스트 로그인 -> 토큰 자동 획득
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test5@test.com",
  "password": "password123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}


### =========================================================================
### 📝 [피드 - Feeds] 도메인 (총 10개 API)
### =========================================================================

### 3. 피드 등록 (createFeed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feeds
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Querydsl 최적화를 적용한 신규 피드",
  "content": "JPA N+1 장애 문제를 전면 리팩토링 완료했습니다.",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "projectId":null,
  "tags": ["Spring", "JPA"],
  "imageUrls": ["/uploads/image1.png"],
  "mentionedUserIds": [2, 3]
}

> {% client.global.set("createdFeedId", response.body.id); %}


### 4. 전체 피드 목록 조회 - 최신순 (getFeeds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. 피드 검색 - 조건 정렬 포함 (searchFeeds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/search?keyword=JPA&tags=Spring&author=홍길동&sort=likes&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. 좋아요한 피드 목록 조회 (getLikedFeeds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/liked?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 7. 팔로잉 피드 목록 조회 (getFollowingFeeds) ✨ [추가됨!]
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/following?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 8. 내 피드 목록 조회 (getMyFeeds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/me?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 9. 피드 단건 조회 (getFeed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 10. 피드 수정 (updateFeed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "수정된 피드 제목",
  "content": "수정된 본문 내용입니다.",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE",
  "projectId": null,
  "tags": ["Refactoring"],
  "imageUrls": ["/uploads/image3.png"],
  "mentionedUserIds": [3]
}


### 11. 좋아요 토글 - 등록/취소 (toggleLike)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}/likes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 12. 피드 삭제 (deleteFeed)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 💬 [댓글 - Comments] 도메인 (총 6개 API)
### =========================================================================

### 13. 댓글/대댓글 작성 (createComment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "이 부분 아키텍처 되게 신선하네요!",
  "parentId": null
}

> {% client.global.set("createdCommentId", response.body.id); %}


### 14. 댓글 목록 계층형 조회 (getComments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 15. 내가 쓴 댓글 목록 조회 (getMyComments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/my?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 16. 댓글 수정 (updateComment)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}/comments/{{createdCommentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "[수정됨] 대댓글 및 부모 댓글 동기화 완료!"
}


### 17. 댓글 삭제 - 피드 기반 (deleteComment)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/feeds/{{createdFeedId}}/comments/{{createdCommentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 18. 댓글 삭제 - 피드ID 없이 독립 삭제 (deleteComment - feedId 없이) ✨ [추가됨!]
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{createdCommentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 📸 [이미지 - Images] 인프라 도메인 (총 2개 API)
### =========================================================================

### 19. 이미지 업로드 (uploadImage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
--WebAppBoundary--


### 20. 이미지 삭제 (deleteImage)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/images/test.png
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 🔔 [알림 - Notifications] 도메인 (총 4개 API)
### =========================================================================

### 21. 알림 목록 조회 (getNotifications)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("targetNotificationId", response.body.content[0].id); %}


### 22. 읽지 않은 알림 수 조회 (getUnreadCount)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 23. 단건 알림 읽음 처리 (readNotification)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{targetNotificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 24. 전체 알림 읽음 처리 (readAllNotifications)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}